  "semanticCorrections": [
    "DiagnosticHub is the actual public owner; DiagnosticManager is not present. DiagnosticSource is publicly constructible.",
    "Diagnostic static facade and hub are host-only; the actual runtime script surface contains the reporter interface and neutral values.",
    "LogSessionId is exported alongside Log; host router and sinks are not.",
    "Event listener priority is per concrete/base-type bucket, not a global priority sort across all types.",
    "Unregistered or quarantined log sinks are not disposed by the router and an in-flight batch can retain its earlier sink snapshot.",
    "Diagnostic stderr fallback is not protected like the Logging fallback; secondary writer failure can propagate.",
    "ConsoleLogSink defaults to plain text and relies on the explicit host color capability."
  ],
